{"id":"82508b70140c7533","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-projective.md","title":"Projective","display":"df-projective — Projective","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-projective","aliases":["58-df-projective","Projective"],"display":"df-projective — Projective","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-surjective.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-projective"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-projective</span><span>Projective</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-projective — Projective"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f8cb046321ba311\" href=\"?note=9f8cb046321ba311\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md\">../batch05/58-df-surjective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,R,+_P,0_P,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P\\in V\">\\(P,R,+_P,0_P,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Module}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Module}_S\\)</span> (fully structured module predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Surjective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Surjective}\\)</span> (surjection predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9f8cb046321ba311\" href=\"?note=9f8cb046321ba311\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md\">../batch05/58-df-surjective.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}_S\\)</span> (homomorphism predicate for designated module structures, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveModuleStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveModuleStructure}_S\\)</span> (projectivity predicate for a designated module structure, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Projective}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Projective}_S\\)</span> (carrier-level compatibility predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}module\\text{-}hom\\text{-}designated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}_S(\nh;A,+_A,\\odot_A;B,+_B,\\odot_B;R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(h,A,B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_A,A\\times A,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_B,B\\times B,B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_A,R\\times A,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_B,R\\times B,B)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\nh(x+_A y)=h(x)+_B h(y)\n\\land h(r\\odot_A x)=r\\odot_Bh(x)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}module\\text{-}hom\\text{-}designated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}_S(\nh;A,+_A,\\odot_A;B,+_B,\\odot_B;R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(h,A,B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_A,A\\times A,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_B,B\\times B,B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_A,R\\times A,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_B,R\\times B,B)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\Bigl(\nh(x+_A y)=h(x)+_B h(y)\n\\land h(r\\odot_A x)=r\\odot_Bh(x)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}structured}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveModuleStructure}_S(\nP,R,+_P,0_P,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Module}_S(P,R,+_P,0_P,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\forall M,N,+_M,0_M,\\odot_M,+_N,0_N,\\odot_N\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_M)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(N,R,+_N,0_N,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_N)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\\forall f,g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}_S(f;M,+_M,\\odot_M;N,+_N,\\odot_N;R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Surjective}(f,M,N)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}{}\\land\n\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}_S(g;P,+_P,\\odot_P;N,+_N,\\odot_N;R)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11mm}{}\\to\\exists\\widetilde g\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}_S(\n\\widetilde g;P,+_P,\\odot_P;M,+_M,\\odot_M;R)\n\\land f\\circ\\widetilde g=g\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}structured}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveModuleStructure}_S(\nP,R,+_P,0_P,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Module}_S(P,R,+_P,0_P,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\forall M,N,+_M,0_M,\\odot_M,+_N,0_N,\\odot_N\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_M)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(N,R,+_N,0_N,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_N)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\\forall f,g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}_S(f;M,+_M,\\odot_M;N,+_N,\\odot_N;R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Surjective}(f,M,N)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}{}\\land\n\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}_S(g;P,+_P,\\odot_P;N,+_N,\\odot_N;R)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11mm}{}\\to\\exists\\widetilde g\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}_S(\n\\widetilde g;P,+_P,\\odot_P;M,+_M,\\odot_M;R)\n\\land f\\circ\\widetilde g=g\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Projective}_S(P,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_P,0_P,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveModuleStructure}_S(\nP,R,+_P,0_P,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Projective}_S(P,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_P,0_P,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveModuleStructure}_S(\nP,R,+_P,0_P,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Projective: lifting property for surjective homomorphisms.</li>\n<li>Every module and every homomorphism in one lifting square now shares the same displayed ring operations and the designated operations on its source and target. Independent carrier-level predicates could otherwise witness incompatible structures.</li>\n<li>The direct-summand and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}^1\">\\(\\operatorname{Ext}^1\\)</span> characterizations are downstream theorems.</li>\n<li>Free <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow\">\\(\\Rightarrow\\)</span> projective <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow\">\\(\\Rightarrow\\)</span> flat</li>\n<li>Over PID: projective = free</li>\n<li>Quivers: projective representations given by idempotents</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rotman, An Introduction to Homological Algebra</li>\n<li>Weibel, An Introduction to Homological Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f8cb046321ba311","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-surjective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S$ (fully structured module predicate; see [[../batch13/58-df-module.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-surjective.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f8cb046321ba311","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Surjective}$ (surjection predicate; see [[../batch05/58-df-surjective.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","